{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ae2H9FPZD2EriC57AVHSos","type":"tool_result","content":"320\t\n321\t/// Fixed-capacity QUIC connection ID.  C: `ConnectionId`.\n322\t///\n323\t/// Stored as a 20-byte buffer plus a length so the type is `Copy`,\n324\t/// matching the C usage where connection IDs are passed by value\n325\t/// in many APIs (`get_local_connection_id`, `create_connection`,\n326\t/// …).  Fields are private — construct via [`Self::clone_from_slice`]\n327\t/// or [`Self::with_size`] and read via [`Self::as_bytes`].\n328\t///\n329\t/// `Ord` is derived as lexicographic over the live bytes (matching\n330\t/// the C `compare_connection_id` shape: per-byte compare under\n331\t/// `min(len_a, len_b)`, then length tie-break).\n332\t#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, PartialOrd, Ord, Hash, Default)]\n333\tpub struct ConnectionId {\n334\t    id: [u8; CONNECTION_ID_MAX_SIZE],\n335\t    id_len: u8,\n336\t}\n337\t\n338\timpl ConnectionId {\n339\t    /// Construct a connection id by copying `bytes`.  Returns `None`"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0fe661b3-3da3-4093-b2dc-59d86edd2999","uuid":"cf064a2d-59fc-4ed4-818b-13b030b74f3d","timestamp":"2026-05-04T22:02:31.988Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/rs/fq/src/lib.rs","content":"\n/// Fixed-capacity QUIC connection ID.  C: `ConnectionId`.\n///\n/// Stored as a 20-byte buffer plus a length so the type is `Copy`,\n/// matching the C usage where connection IDs are passed by value\n/// in many APIs (`get_local_connection_id`, `create_connection`,\n/// …).  Fields are private — construct via [`Self::clone_from_slice`]\n/// or [`Self::with_size`] and read via [`Self::as_bytes`].\n///\n/// `Ord` is derived as lexicographic over the live bytes (matching\n/// the C `compare_connection_id` shape: per-byte compare under\n/// `min(len_a, len_b)`, then length tie-break).\n#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, P